    "title": "Craven Community College Hosting ECU Transfer Event in Havelock - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By News 12 Staff ,\n1 days ago CRAVEN COUNTY, NC — Students thinking about taking the next step in their education will have a chance to explore their options today in Havelock. Craven Community College is teaming up with East Carolina University to host “Craven: A Path to ECU,” a transfer-focused event on Tuesday, March 24, from 2 to 6 p.m. The event will be held inside the Institute of Aeronautical Technology hangar on Craven’s Havelock campus. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
